:name: BlackPill F411 FreeRTOS
:description: FreeRTOS V11 tasks, queue, timer and blink on a BlackPill-like STM32F4.
# Variables set by ./renode-box examples run: $ex_dir, $ex_out
$elf?=$ex_out/blackpill_freertos.elf

using sysbus
mach create "blackpill"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/blackpill_f411.repl
showAnalyzer usart1

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
